# Backend — LangGraph Aid Desk

## Orchestration

Use **LangGraph** only. Graph: `Intake → Triage → Knowledge → Integrity → Matcher → Dispatch`.

Never route Intake directly to Matcher — Integrity is mandatory. Knowledge runs after Triage.

## HITL

Pause graph when `priority == critical` OR `integrity.risk_score` high. Resume only via supervisor `approve|reject` API.

Append every node execution to `agent_trace` for SSE/UI.

## LLM

DashScope Qwen via `backend/app/services/llm.py`. Support `LLM_MODE=mock` for tests.

Bilingual prompts in `backend/app/agents/prompts/` (en + ur).

## Tools

Implement as plain Python functions in `backend/app/tools/` — MCP-style contracts. No Hermes runtime.

## Tier scope

Implement **Tier B** (Knowledge, timeline, PDF, roles, seed) without breaking Tier A E2E.

## Tests required

- Happy path (Urdu food)
- Duplicate phone flag
- Critical → HITL → approve
